      "content": "Those glitches sound frustrating. They could be caused by several factors, including:\n\n1. Overlapping elements or z-index issues, causing some parts of the UI to hide behind others.\n2. CSS hover states or transitions that might inadvertently hide elements.\n3. JavaScript event listeners not properly attached, which could prevent interactions with elements.\n4. Touch targeting issues, where interactive elements are too small or too close together.\n5. Accessibility conflicts, such as improper titles or lack of focus states.\n\nCheck your z-index for layering issues, ensure hover/transition effects are not affecting visibility, verify event listener assignments, review touch target sizes, and audit for proper ARIA roles and labels. Use your browser's developer tools to inspect elements and console logs for errors.",
